# 6. Story Assignment History

Do not overwrite historical story assignments.

When a customer finishes Story 7 and moves to Story 13:

```text
Customer Story Assignment #1
Story 7
COMPLETED

Customer Story Assignment #2
Story 13
ACTIVE
```

This gives a complete story journey.

