# 11. Template language

Do not allow arbitrary code execution in templates.

The renderer must use a safe, allowlisted template engine.

Supported features:

### Variables

```text
{{customer.first_name}}
{{product.name}}
{{letter.title}}
{{letter.content}}
{{previous_letter.continuity_summary}}
```

### Conditions

```text
{{#if previous_letter}}
...
{{/if}}
```

### Optional else

```text
{{#if previous_letter}}
...
{{else}}
...
{{/if}}
```

Do NOT support arbitrary SQL, JavaScript, Python, shell commands, or executable expressions.

