# 56. Data privacy

Only inject necessary customer data into templates.

Default variables:

```text
first_name
display_name
product name
order information required by the letter
```

Do not expose sensitive fields to the template context unless explicitly required.

Do not log full rendered letters in application logs.

The stored snapshot should be access-controlled.

