Recommended:

```text
First print:
allocate + render + snapshot

Subsequent reprint:
return existing delivery snapshot
```

Do not run template selection again.

Do not increment story sequence.

Do not create a new story letter.

Optional:

```text
reprint_count
last_reprinted_at
```

